---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Scientific Articles - CCPAC | Chittagong College Physics & Astronomy Club" activePage="explore">


    <!-- Glowing Background Effect -->
    <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[1400px] h-[600px] bg-cyan-500/10 blur-[200px] rounded-full pointer-events-none"></div>

    <!-- Navigation Bar -->
    

    <!-- Back to Activities -->
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 pt-8">
        <a href="/activities" class="inline-flex items-center space-x-2 text-sm font-semibold text-cyan-400 hover:text-cyan-300 transition">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left"></i>
            <span>Back to Activities</span>
        </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 pt-8 pb-8 text-center space-y-4">
        <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-black tracking-tight text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-400 via-blue-400 to-indigo-400 uppercase font-poppins">
            ARTICLE
        </h1>
        <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base max-w-2xl mx-auto font-sans leading-relaxed">
            CCPAC promotes scientific communication through article writing, giving members the opportunity to express ideas, summarize insights from sessions, and explain complex physics or astronomy concepts.
        </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Articles Grid Section -->
    <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-4 space-y-12">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">

            <!-- Special Feature: Chandrasekhar Limit -->
            <div class="glass-card rounded-3xl border border-cyan-500/40 shadow-2xl overflow-hidden glow-box flex flex-col justify-between">
                <div>
                    <div class="h-48 overflow-hidden bg-slate-950 border-b border-slate-800 relative group">
                        <img src="/images/c1.jpg" alt="Chandrasekhar Limit" class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition duration-500 crisp-img">
                        <span class="absolute top-4 left-4 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/20 border border-cyan-500/40 text-cyan-300 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider font-poppins">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-star mr-1"></i> Special Feature
                        </span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-6 space-y-3 text-xs text-slate-300">
                        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white leading-snug font-poppins">Aiming for the Next Star: The Chandrasekhar Limit of Footballing Heritage</h3>
                        <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed line-clamp-3 font-sans pt-1">
                            Tonight in New Jersey, Spain and Argentina meet in the FIFA World Cup 2026 Final. Breaking down footballing heritage through stellar physics...
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="p-6 pt-0">
                    <button onclick="openModal('chandrasekharModal')" class="inline-flex items-center space-x-2 bg-slate-900 hover:bg-cyan-500 hover:text-slate-950 text-slate-200 border border-slate-700 hover:border-cyan-400 font-bold px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-xs transition duration-300 w-full justify-center cursor-pointer">
                        <span>Learn more</span>
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right text-[10px]"></i>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Farhan Ahmad Articles -->
            <div class="glass-card rounded-3xl border border-slate-800 shadow-2xl overflow-hidden glow-box flex flex-col justify-between">
                <div>
                    <div class="h-48 overflow-hidden bg-slate-950 border-b border-slate-800 relative group">
                        <img src="/images/fr0.jpeg" alt="Farhan Ahmad Articles" class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition duration-500 crisp-img">
                        <span class="absolute top-4 left-4 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-900/80 backdrop-blur-md border border-slate-700 text-cyan-400 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase font-poppins">
                            Featured Article
                        </span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-6 space-y-3 text-xs text-slate-300">
                        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white leading-snug font-poppins">Through the Hill: How Quantum Mechanics Breaks the Rules</h3>
                        <p><strong class="text-cyan-400">Author:</strong> Farhan Ahmad <span class="text-slate-400">(Roll: 1202526010031)</span></p>
                        <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed line-clamp-2 font-sans">An exploration of quantum tunneling defying classical intuition, wave-particle duality, and Heisenberg's Uncertainty Principle.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="p-6 pt-0">
                    <button onclick="openModal('farhanModal')" class="inline-flex items-center space-x-2 bg-slate-900 hover:bg-cyan-500 hover:text-slate-950 text-slate-200 border border-slate-700 hover:border-cyan-400 font-bold px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-xs transition duration-300 w-full justify-center cursor-pointer">
                        <span>Learn more</span>
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right text-[10px]"></i>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Stellar Evolution Series -->
            <div class="glass-card rounded-3xl border border-slate-800 shadow-2xl overflow-hidden glow-box flex flex-col justify-between">
                <div>
                    <div class="h-48 overflow-hidden bg-slate-950 border-b border-slate-800 relative group">
                        <img src="/images/st0.jpeg" alt="Stellar Evolution Series" class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition duration-500 crisp-img">
                        <span class="absolute top-4 left-4 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-900/80 backdrop-blur-md border border-slate-700 text-cyan-400 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase font-poppins">
                            Stellar Evolution
                        </span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-6 space-y-3 text-xs text-slate-300">
                        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white leading-snug font-poppins">নক্ষত্রের বিবর্তন: নীহারিকা থেকে কৃষ্ণগহ্বর (তারার জীবনচক্র ও গঠন)</h3>
                        <p><strong class="text-cyan-400">Authors:</strong> Rajarshi Das Gupta <span class="text-slate-400">(Roll: 1202526010041)</span>, Efaj Mahadi Bhuiyan <span class="text-slate-400">(Roll: 1202526010128)</span></p>
                        <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed line-clamp-2 font-sans">হাইড্রোস্ট্যাটিক সাম্যাবস্থা, ফিউশন শক্তির পরিবহন এবং তারার স্তরবিন্যাসযুক্ত অভ্যন্তরীণ গঠন নিয়ে বিস্তারিত আলোচনা।</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="p-6 pt-0">
                    <button onclick="openModal('stellar2Modal')" class="inline-flex items-center space-x-2 bg-slate-900 hover:bg-cyan-500 hover:text-slate-950 text-slate-200 border border-slate-700 hover:border-cyan-400 font-bold px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-xs transition duration-300 w-full justify-center cursor-pointer">
                        <span>Learn more</span>
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right text-[10px]"></i>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Pi Day Article -->
            <div class="glass-card rounded-3xl border border-slate-800 shadow-2xl overflow-hidden glow-box flex flex-col justify-between">
                <div>
                    <div class="h-48 overflow-hidden bg-slate-950 border-b border-slate-800 relative group">
                        <img src="/images/pi1.jpeg" alt="Pi Day Article" class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition duration-500 crisp-img">
                        <span class="absolute top-4 left-4 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-900/80 backdrop-blur-md border border-slate-700 text-cyan-400 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase font-poppins">
                            Pi Day Special
                        </span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-6 space-y-3 text-xs text-slate-300">
                        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white leading-snug font-poppins">π Tends To 4: Story of Pi and Number 4</h3>
                        <p><strong class="text-cyan-400">Author:</strong> Prithwijit Mallik <span class="text-slate-400">(Roll: 1202425010176)</span></p>
                        <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed line-clamp-2 font-sans">Though π is irrational, why has it tended to its nearest natural number 4? Exploring the mathematical paradox.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="p-6 pt-0">
                    <button onclick="openModal('pidayModal')" class="inline-flex items-center space-x-2 bg-slate-900 hover:bg-cyan-500 hover:text-slate-950 text-slate-200 border border-slate-700 hover:border-cyan-400 font-bold px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-xs transition duration-300 w-full justify-center cursor-pointer">
                        <span>Learn more</span>
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right text-[10px]"></i>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Rajarshi Das Gupta Article -->
            <div class="glass-card rounded-3xl border border-slate-800 shadow-2xl overflow-hidden glow-box flex flex-col justify-between">
                <div>
                    <div class="h-48 overflow-hidden bg-slate-950 border-b border-slate-800 relative group">
                        <img src="/images/r1.jpeg" alt="Skipping Stone" class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition duration-500 crisp-img">
                        <span class="absolute top-4 left-4 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-900/80 backdrop-blur-md border border-slate-700 text-cyan-400 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase font-poppins">
                            Physics Research
                        </span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-6 space-y-3 text-xs text-slate-300">
                        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white leading-snug font-poppins">The Physics of a Skipping Stone: Underdamped Motion</h3>
                        <p><strong class="text-cyan-400">Author:</strong> Rajarshi Das Gupta <span class="text-slate-400">(Roll: 1202526010041)</span></p>
                        <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed line-clamp-2 font-sans">Every skip is a battle between momentum and drag, explained through differential equations and fluid-surface interactions.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="p-6 pt-0">
                    <button onclick="openModal('skippingModal')" class="inline-flex items-center space-x-2 bg-slate-900 hover:bg-cyan-500 hover:text-slate-950 text-slate-200 border border-slate-700 hover:border-cyan-400 font-bold px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-xs transition duration-300 w-full justify-center cursor-pointer">
                        <span>Learn more</span>
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right text-[10px]"></i>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Sajjad Hosen Sakib Article -->
            <!-- <div class="glass-card rounded-3xl border border-slate-800 shadow-2xl overflow-hidden glow-box flex flex-col justify-between">
                <div>
                    <div class="h-48 overflow-hidden bg-slate-950 border-b border-slate-800 relative group">
                        <img src="/images/sh1.jpeg" alt="Particle Dynamics" class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition duration-500 crisp-img">
                        <span class="absolute top-4 left-4 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-900/80 backdrop-blur-md border border-slate-700 text-cyan-400 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase font-poppins">
                            Atmospheric Dynamics
                        </span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-6 space-y-3 text-xs text-slate-300">
                        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white leading-snug font-poppins">Particle Dynamics in Stratified Planetary Atmospheres</h3>
                        <p><strong class="text-cyan-400">Author:</strong> Sajjad Hosen Sakib <span class="text-slate-400">(Roll: 1202425010149)</span></p>
                        <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed line-clamp-2 font-sans">An advanced study combining analytical modeling, numerical simulations, and survey-based educational insights.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="p-6 pt-0">
                    <button onclick="openModal('sajjadModal')" class="inline-flex items-center space-x-2 bg-slate-900 hover:bg-cyan-500 hover:text-slate-950 text-slate-200 border border-slate-700 hover:border-cyan-400 font-bold px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-xs transition duration-300 w-full justify-center cursor-pointer">
                        <span>Learn more</span>
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right text-[10px]"></i>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div> -->

        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ======================================================= -->
    <!-- ARTICLE DETAIL MODALS -->
    <!-- ======================================================= -->

    <!-- 1. Chandrasekhar Limit Modal -->
    <div id="chandrasekharModal" class="fixed inset-0 z-50 bg-slate-950/80 backdrop-blur-md hidden flex items-center justify-center p-4">
        <div class="glass-card max-w-3xl w-full max-h-[90vh] overflow-y-auto custom-scrollbar rounded-3xl border border-cyan-500/30 shadow-2xl p-6 sm:p-10 relative space-y-6">
            <button onclick="closeModal('chandrasekharModal')" class="absolute top-4 right-4 bg-slate-900 hover:bg-cyan-500 hover:text-slate-950 text-slate-300 w-10 h-10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center transition border border-slate-700 shadow-lg z-20 cursor-pointer">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-xmark text-lg"></i>
            </button>
            <div class="space-y-4 pr-8">
                <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/20 border border-cyan-500/40 text-cyan-300 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider font-poppins inline-block">
                    Special Feature
                </span>
                <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-white font-poppins leading-snug">
                    Aiming for the Next Star: The Chandrasekhar Limit of Footballing Heritage
                </h2>
                
                <!-- Image Slider for Chandrasekhar Modal (c1 to c7 as jpg) -->
                <div class="slider-container relative w-full overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800">
                    <div class="slider-track flex transition-transform duration-500 ease-in-out">
                        <div class="slide min-w-full flex items-center justify-center bg-black"><img src="/images/c1.jpg" alt="c1" class="max-w-full max-h-[400px] w-auto h-auto object-contain crisp-img"></div>
                        <div class="slide min-w-full flex items-center justify-center bg-black"><img src="/images/c2.jpg" alt="c2" class="max-w-full max-h-[400px] w-auto h-auto object-contain crisp-img"></div>
                        <div class="slide min-w-full flex items-center justify-center bg-black"><img src="/images/c3.jpg" alt="c3" class="max-w-full max-h-[400px] w-auto h-auto object-contain crisp-img"></div>
                        <div class="slide min-w-full flex items-center justify-center bg-black"><img src="/images/c4.jpg" alt="c4" class="max-w-full max-h-[400px] w-auto h-auto object-contain crisp-img"></div>
                        <div class="slide min-w-full flex items-center justify-center bg-black"><img src="/images/c5.jpg" alt="c5" class="max-w-full max-h-[400px] w-auto h-auto object-contain crisp-img"></div>
                        <div class="slide min-w-full flex items-center justify-center bg-black"><img src="/images/c6.jpg" alt="c6" class="max-w-full max-h-[400px] w-auto h-auto object-contain crisp-img"></div>
                        <div class="slide min-w-full flex items-center justify-center bg-black"><img src="/images/c7.jpg" alt="c7" class="max-w-full max-h-[400px] w-auto h-auto object-contain crisp-img"></div>
                    </div>
                    <button onclick="moveSlide(this, -1)" class="absolute left-2 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 bg-black/70 hover:bg-black text-white px-3 py-2 rounded-lg z-10 cursor-pointer">&#10094;</button>
                    <button onclick="moveSlide(this, 1)" class="absolute right-2 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 bg-black/70 hover:bg-black text-white px-3 py-2 rounded-lg z-10 cursor-pointer">&#10095;</button>
                </div>

                <div class="text-slate-300 text-xs sm:text-sm space-y-4 font-sans leading-relaxed pt-2">
                    <p>Tonight in New Jersey, Spain and Argentina meet in the FIFA World Cup 2026 Final. This article bridges the gap between astrophysics and the beautiful game, analyzing footballing heritage, tactical pressure, and legacy through the lens of stellar physics and the famous Chandrasekhar Limit.</p>
                    <p>Just as a star balances gravitational collapse with internal thermal pressure up to a critical mass limit, legendary football squads maintain tactical equilibrium under immense global spotlight before a breakthrough changes everything.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="pt-4 border-t border-slate-800 flex justify-end">
                <button onclick="closeModal('chandrasekharModal')" class="px-6 py-2.5 bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-200 rounded-xl text-xs font-semibold transition border border-slate-700 cursor-pointer">Close</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 2. Farhan Ahmad Modal -->
    <div id="farhanModal" class="fixed inset-0 z-50 bg-slate-950/80 backdrop-blur-md hidden flex items-center justify-center p-4">
        <div class="glass-card max-w-3xl w-full max-h-[90vh] overflow-y-auto custom-scrollbar rounded-3xl border border-slate-800 shadow-2xl p-6 sm:p-10 relative space-y-6">
            <button onclick="closeModal('farhanModal')" class="absolute top-4 right-4 bg-slate-900 hover:bg-cyan-500 hover:text-slate-950 text-slate-300 w-10 h-10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center transition border border-slate-700 shadow-lg z-20 cursor-pointer">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-xmark text-lg"></i>
            </button>
            <div class="space-y-4 pr-8">
                <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 text-cyan-400 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase font-poppins inline-block">
                    Featured Article
                </span>
                <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-white font-poppins leading-snug">
                    Through the Hill: How Quantum Mechanics Breaks the Rules
                </h2>
                <p class="text-xs text-cyan-400 font-semibold">Author: Farhan Ahmad <span class="text-slate-400">(Roll: 1202526010031)</span></p>
                
                <!-- Image Slider for Farhan Modal (fr0 to fr4) -->
                <div class="slider-container relative w-full overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800">
                    <div class="slider-track flex transition-transform duration-500 ease-in-out">
                        <div class="slide min-w-full flex items-center justify-center bg-black"><img src="/images/fr0.jpeg" alt="fr0" class="max-w-full max-h-[400px] w-auto h-auto object-contain crisp-img"></div>
                        <div class="slide min-w-full flex items-center justify-center bg-black"><img src="/images/fr1.jpeg" alt="fr1" class="max-w-full max-h-[400px] w-auto h-auto object-contain crisp-img"></div>
                        <div class="slide min-w-full flex items-center justify-center bg-black"><img src="/images/fr2.jpeg" alt="fr2" class="max-w-full max-h-[400px] w-auto h-auto object-contain crisp-img"></div>
                        <div class="slide min-w-full flex items-center justify-center bg-black"><img src="/images/fr3.jpeg" alt="fr3" class="max-w-full max-h-[400px] w-auto h-auto object-contain crisp-img"></div>
                        <div class="slide min-w-full flex items-center justify-center bg-black"><img src="/images/fr4.jpeg" alt="fr4" class="max-w-full max-h-[400px] w-auto h-auto object-contain crisp-img"></div>
                    </div>
                    <button onclick="moveSlide(this, -1)" class="absolute left-2 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 bg-black/70 hover:bg-black text-white px-3 py-2 rounded-lg z-10 cursor-pointer">&#10094;</button>
                    <button onclick="moveSlide(this, 1)" class="absolute right-2 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 bg-black/70 hover:bg-black text-white px-3 py-2 rounded-lg z-10 cursor-pointer">&#10095;</button>
                </div>

                <div class="text-slate-300 text-xs sm:text-sm space-y-4 font-sans leading-relaxed pt-2">
                    <p>An exploration of quantum tunneling defying classical intuition. In classical mechanics, a particle without sufficient energy cannot cross a potential energy barrier. However, quantum mechanics introduces wave-particle duality and probability amplitudes, allowing particles to slip right through.</p>
                    <p>This deep-dive article covers wave functions, Heisenberg's Uncertainty Principle, and real-world occurrences like stellar fusion in main-sequence stars governed by quantum probability.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="pt-4 border-t border-slate-800 flex justify-end">
                <button onclick="closeModal('farhanModal')" class="px-6 py-2.5 bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-200 rounded-xl text-xs font-semibold transition border border-slate-700 cursor-pointer">Close</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 3. Stellar Evolution Series Modal -->
    <div id="stellar2Modal" class="fixed inset-0 z-50 bg-slate-950/80 backdrop-blur-md hidden flex items-center justify-center p-4">
        <div class="glass-card max-w-3xl w-full max-h-[90vh] overflow-y-auto custom-scrollbar rounded-3xl border border-slate-800 shadow-2xl p-6 sm:p-10 relative space-y-6">
